{
  "format": "blinkfx/1",
  "id": "com.codexo.ssf.bouncy_hexagons",
  "title": "Bouncy Hexagons",
  "author": "mrange",
  "description": "An infinite field of audio-reactive 3D hexagons that rise and fall with your music. Red and black hexagons respond to different frequency ranges, creating dynamic landscapes of sound. Fly through the geometric terrain with customizable colors, lighting, and camera controls for stunning live visuals.",
